usage: s_seir_batch_contracts.py [-h] [--glob GLOB] [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]
                                 [--sseir-output SSEIR_OUTPUT]
                                 [--assembly-output ASSEMBLY_OUTPUT]
                                 [--write-aggregate] [--contract CONTRACT]
                                 [--include-abstract]
                                 [--keep-sources-without-assembly]
                                 [--flat-glob-mode]
                                 [--max-sources-per-sample MAX_SOURCES_PER_SAMPLE]
                                 [--no-branch-preprocess]
                                 [--solc-bin SOLC_BIN]
                                 [--solc-cache-dir SOLC_CACHE_DIR]
                                 [--deps-dir DEPS_DIR] [--no-install-deps]
                                 [--slither-bin SLITHER_BIN]
                                 [--workdir WORKDIR] [--fail-fast]
                                 [input]

Batch S-SEIR analysis for verified deployed contract samples, excluding
libraries/interfaces.

positional arguments:
  input                 Solidity file or sample root directory.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --glob GLOB           Glob used when input is a directory. Default:
                        */Token.sol
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --sseir-output SSEIR_OUTPUT
                        Deprecated. Use per-source result directories under
                        --output-dir.
  --assembly-output ASSEMBLY_OUTPUT
                        Deprecated. Use per-source result directories under
                        --output-dir.
  --write-aggregate     Also write legacy aggregate JSON outputs.
  --contract CONTRACT   Only include this deployed contract name. Can be
                        repeated.
  --include-abstract    Include abstract contractKind=contract definitions.
  --keep-sources-without-assembly
  --flat-glob-mode      Do not group 0x sample directories; use --glob
                        directly.
  --max-sources-per-sample MAX_SOURCES_PER_SAMPLE
  --no-branch-preprocess
  --solc-bin SOLC_BIN
  --solc-cache-dir SOLC_CACHE_DIR
  --deps-dir DEPS_DIR
  --no-install-deps
  --slither-bin SLITHER_BIN
  --workdir WORKDIR
  --fail-fast
